// Foraging plants: wild vegetables and roots, grains and pulses, berry and fruit bushes,
// herbs and spices, mushrooms, shrubs and flowers. Each draws on a shared shape (a leafy
// root, a vine with its fruit, pods, a low berry carpet, a shelf fungus) in its own colours,
// or on another plant's sprite where the two are kin (barley on wild wheat, dill on wild
// carrot), so the set reads as one family. Sprites use the legend of plants.ron.
(
    legend: {
        'a': "leaf:0", 'b': "leaf:1", 'c': "leaf:2", 'd': "leaf:3", 'e': "leaf:4",
        'p': "petal:0", 'q': "petal:1", 'r': "petal:2", 's': "petal:3",
        'x': "centre:0", 'y': "centre:1", 'z': "centre:2",
        'k': "wood:0", 'l': "wood:1", 'm': "wood:2",
        'f': "fruit:0", 'h': "fruit:1", 'j': "fruit:2",
        'W': "#f4f1ea",
    },
